This is a deliberately harmless text fixture for model-due-diligence tests.

It is named model.gguf.fake so that tests can exercise file inventory,
hashing, safe text handling and report generation without including a real
model artefact in the repository.

This file is not a valid GGUF model.
It must not be loaded by any model runtime.
It contains no executable code, credentials or binary payloads.
